# Always ship

After finishing a product change in this repo, commit it, push `main`, then run `npm run build:staging` and `npm run deploy:staging`. Do not wait for the user to say push.

Still skip secrets, `supabase/.gitignore`, and `supabase/config.toml`. Do not skip git hooks. Do not force-push `main`.
